// Legal Rust. TODAY refused: "let 'a': variance mismatch — expected A<'_>, got
// A<'q>". The method path instantiates the ARGUMENTS through
// `inst_call_params_` (census `inst.call.differs` fires) but types the RESULT
// with its own `lt_subst`, which records a callee region only when the
// argument's region is NON-EMPTY — `&v` has none, so `'q` survives by name.
